.TH SET-GITHUBREPOSITORY 1 "October 2026" "Noble Factor" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
Set-GitHubRepository \- set a site repository's secrets, branch protection ruleset, merge settings and default branch
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B Set-GitHubRepository
.RB [ \-h | \-\-help ]
.B \-\-repo
.I owner/repo
.RB [ \-\-default\-branch
.IR branch ]
.RB [ \-\-skip\-secrets ]
.RB [ \-\-skip\-protection ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Set-GitHubRepository
configures a site's repository, in order:
.IP 1. 3
the secrets AZURE_STATIC_WEB_APPS_API_TOKEN, AZURE_CREDENTIALS and SITE_DEPLOY_TOKEN, each from the variable of
its name, each one unset reported and skipped;
.IP 2. 3
the ruleset
.IR "Branch Protection" ,
created or updated in place, over the default branch, main and release/*: a pull request with one approval, stale
reviews dismissed, linear history, no force push, and the repository's admins able to bypass only by merging a pull
request;
.IP 3. 3
squash merges only, a merged branch deleted, auto-merge off;
.IP 4. 3
the default branch, when it differs.
.PP
It ends by printing what it set, and the repository's secrets by name.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show this manual page and exit.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-repo " " \fIowner/repo\fR
The repository. Required.
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-default\-branch " " \fIbranch\fR
The default branch. Default: develop.
.TP
.B \-\-skip\-secrets
Set no secrets.
.TP
.B \-\-skip\-protection
Leave the ruleset as it is.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AZURE_STATIC_WEB_APPS_API_TOKEN
The Static Web App's deployment token.
.TP
.B AZURE_CREDENTIALS
The service principal's credentials, as JSON.
.TP
.B SITE_DEPLOY_TOKEN
The token that syncs content across repositories.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success \- the repository is configured.
.TP
.B 64
Usage error \- a missing or invalid option.
.TP
.B 69
A tool it needs is not on PATH.
.TP
.B 77
Not logged in to GitHub, or the repository cannot be seen.
.TP
.B 72
Critical file missing \- \fBDeclare-BashScript\fR is not on PATH; deploy the base layer, NobleFactor/noblefactor-engprod.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
bin/Set-GitHubRepository --repo NobleFactor/devlore.noblefactor.com --default-branch develop
.fi
